  "releaseNotes": "BuildRequest now also drops an empty TextBlock from history (previously only empty thinking blocks were filtered), and skips a message entirely if every one of its blocks was dropped this way — Anthropic rejects both an empty text content block and a message with an empty content array. This is defense-in-depth for conversation history persisted before the matching Universal.Operative.Sdk 1.3.1 fix, or from any other source of a bad block, so a conversation already carrying one can recover just by upgrading rather than needing hand-editing.",
